    "390": {
      "date": "2026-11-22",
      "edition": "Sunday 22 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Finals shuffle",
          "heading": "Gregor Townsend says points blitz leaves Scotland's Twickenham finals week undecided",
          "body": "Scotland head coach Gregor Townsend admitted his side had one eye on the scoreboard during the 67-5 rout of Japan, telling BBC Scotland that reaching a points total was an ambition the players delivered. The consequence is uncertainty over the finals weekend at Twickenham: \"We don't know what our week's going to look like,\" he said, adding that without the points haul the schedule would already have been settled. SA Rugby Magazine reports Scotland stay fourth in the northern hemisphere table, but with a vastly improved points difference."
        },
