          "kicker": "Pre-match tribute",
          "heading": "French federation honours Federico Martín Aramburu with son in Pumas shirt",
          "body": "The French Rugby Federation arranged for the late Argentine's son to walk out in an Argentina jersey before Saturday's test against France. He would hold the hands of both captains, Argentina's Julián Montoya and France scrum-half Antoine Dupont, in recognition of his dual nationality. A minute's applause was planned at the Stade de France. Martín Aramburu, a former Argentine player well known in the French championship in the early 2000s, was killed in a Paris street in 2022, aged 42. Two far-right activists were sentenced to 26 and 19 years."
        },
